### Acquisition Method

**Method:** Internet Archive bulk download via `ia` CLI tool or direct HTTP.

**Option A — Internet Archive CLI (recommended):**
```bash
# Install ia tool
pip install internetarchive

# Authenticate (optional, for larger downloads)
ia configure

# Download entire collection
ia download --search "collection:NIST_WTC_Investigation_Reports" --destdir WTC_CORPUS/engineering-reports/
```

**Option B — Direct HTTP (per-file):**
```bash
# List all files in the item
curl -sL "https://archive.org/metadata/NIST_WTC_Investigation_Reports-861612" | \
  python3 -c "import json,sys; d=json.load(sys.stdin); [print(f['name']) for f in d.get('files',[])]"

# Download each file
curl -L -o "WTC_CORPUS/engineering-reports/<filename>" \
  "https://archive.org/download/NIST_WTC_Investigation_Reports-861612/<filename>"
```

**Option C — Manual browser download:**
1. Visit `https://archive.org/details/NIST_WTC_Investigation_Reports-861612`
2. Click "DOWNLOAD OPTIONS" on the right sidebar
3. Select "PDF" or "Original" for each report
4. Save to `WTC_CORPUS/engineering-reports/`

